{"number":105,"nameArabic":"الفيل","nameTransliterated":"Al-Fil","nameTranslated":"The Elephant","revelationPlace":"makkah","versesCount":5,"verses":[{"ayah":1,"verseKey":"105:1","textAr":"أَلَمۡ تَرَ كَيۡفَ فَعَلَ رَبُّكَ بِأَصۡحَٰبِ ٱلۡفِيلِ","transliteration":"Alam tara kayfa faAAala rabbuka biashabi alfeeli","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Have you not considered, [O Muhammad], how your Lord dealt with the companions of the elephant"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"تم نے دیکھا نہیں کہ تمہارے رب نے ہاتھی والوں کے ساتھ کیا کیا؟"}]},{"ayah":2,"verseKey":"105:2","textAr":"أَلَمۡ يَجۡعَلۡ كَيۡدَهُمۡ فِي تَضۡلِيلٖ","transliteration":"Alam yajAAal kaydahum fee tadleelin","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Did He not make their plan into misguidance"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"کیا اُس نے اُن کی تدبیر کو اکارت نہیں کر دیا؟"}]},{"ayah":3,"verseKey":"105:3","textAr":"وَأَرۡسَلَ عَلَيۡهِمۡ طَيۡرًا أَبَابِيلَ","transliteration":"Waarsala AAalayhim tayran ababeela","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And He sent against them birds in flocks"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور اُن پر پرندوں کے جھنڈ کے جھنڈ بھیج دیے"}]},{"ayah":4,"verseKey":"105:4","textAr":"تَرۡمِيهِم بِحِجَارَةٖ مِّن سِجِّيلٖ","transliteration":"Tarmeehim bihijaratin min sijjeelin","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Striking them with stones of hard clay"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"جو اُن پر پکی ہوئی مٹی کے پتھر پھینک رہے تھے"}]},{"ayah":5,"verseKey":"105:5","textAr":"فَجَعَلَهُمۡ كَعَصۡفٖ مَّأۡكُولِۭ","transliteration":"FajaAAalahum kaAAasfin makoolin","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And He made them like eaten straw"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"پھر اُن کا یہ حال کر دیا جیسے جانوروں کا کھایا ہوا بھوسا"}]}]}